OL,3,GNEWSADUP MLA joins Lockhart's call for
OL,4,AO'Neill's removal as first minister
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Democratic Unionist Party (DUP)
OL,7,Fassembly member has joined MP colleague
OL,8,FCarla Lockhart's calls for Stormont's
OL,9,FFirst Minister Michelle O'Neill to be
OL,10,F"removed from office".
OL,12,FDiane Forsythe said "profound
OL,13,Fconsequences" pledged over the Sinn
OL,14,FFein vice-president's handling of the
OL,15,FDrumcree parading dispute "must be
OL,16,Fhonoured".
OL,18,FLockhart last week stepped down from
OL,19,Fthe DUP's officer board in response to
OL,20,Fparty leader Gavin Robinson not
OL,21,Fremoving their deputy first minister to
OL,22,Fforce O'Neill from the joint office.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
