OL,3,GNEWSADUP MLA joins Lockhart's call for
OL,4,AO'Neill's removal as first minister
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt follows unionist anger over the
OL,7,Ffirst minister's involvement in
OL,8,Fprotests on the Garvaghy Road, which
OL,9,Fblocked a contentious Orange Order
OL,10,Fparade from passing along the mainly
OL,11,Fnationalist street in Portadown, County
OL,12,FArmagh.
